+  *            @arg TIM_TIM3_TI1_COMP2:               TIM3 TI1 is connected to COMP2 output
+  *            @arg TIM_TIM3_TI1_COMP1_COMP2:         TIM3 TI1 is connected to logical OR between COMP1 and COMP2 output
