+  *                   field2 can have the following values:
+  *            @arg TIM_TIM3_ETR_GPIO:                TIM3_ETR is connected to GPIO
+  *            @arg TIM_TIM3_ETR_COMP1:               TIM3_ETR is connected to COMP1 output
