+  *            @arg TIM_TIM8_ETR_ADC2_AWD1:          TIM8_ETR is connected to ADC2 AWD1
+  *            @arg TIM_TIM8_ETR_ADC2_AWD2:          TIM8_ETR is connected to ADC2 AWD2
