+  *            @arg TIM_TIM16_TI1_LSI:               TIM16 TI1 is connected to LSI
+  *            @arg TIM_TIM16_TI1_LSE:               TIM16 TI1 is connected to LSE
+  *            @arg TIM_TIM16_TI1_RTC:               TIM16 TI1 is connected to RTC wakeup interrupt
